                                                "sense_id": "3f9133ab-a9a8-3f71-b132-86edcdab14ed",
                                                "text": "In the Province of Xenſi, near the City Vucung, is a Hill called Taipe, which if a Drum be beaten upon it, preſently followeth Thunder, Lightning, and ſtormy weather, inſomuch that the Magiſtrates have forbidden all perſons upon pain of death to beat any Drum there."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e17da16-7345-4455-9f8b-50b0b2b34d53",
                                                "sense_id": "3f9133ab-a9a8-3f71-b132-86edcdab14ed",
                                                "text": "The group played huge drums placed overhead, along with flutes and a kotolike zither."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
